=== A: flag form, DEPTH 4
--- ric3-ic3, limit 30s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_d                          assume  unprocessed
m_one1                       assume  unprocessed
m_one2                       assume  unprocessed
a_order                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_once1                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_once2                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_both                       cover   covered       ric3-ic3   depth 3
